    },
    "hook-rich-text": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "hook-heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Two formulas, one routine for skin that reacts to everything else.",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "hook-text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The Sensitive Skin Moisturizing Set pairs our two most reactive-skin-friendly products: a daily lotion and an overnight cream, both Pure Unscented.<\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "hook-heading",
        "hook-text"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "text_alignment": "center",
        "mobile_text_alignment": "center",
        "horizontal_content": false,
        "narrow": false,
        "show_divider": false,
        "use_custom_colors": true,
        "colors_button_label": "#ffffff",
        "colors_button_background": "#1a1b18",
        "colors_text": "#212326",
        "colors_background": "#faf7f0",
        "gradient_background": "",
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 12
      }
    },
    "hero-ingredient-cards": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "ingredient-card-1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/why-1-lotion.webp",
            "title": "Daytime: Lotion",
            "title_size": "medium",
            "text": "<p>Light, fast-absorbing daily moisture. Cold-pressed virgin coconut oil and organic jojoba sink in within minutes — no film under clothes. Use after a shower, after handwashing, after anything that strips.<\/p>",
            "button_label": ""
          }
        },
        "ingredient-card-2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/why-2-cream.webp",
            "title": "Overnight: Cream",
            "title_size": "medium",
            "text": "<p>Thicker barrier for repair. Organic beeswax forms a breathable seal so the cream stays where you apply it and works while you sleep. Use on dry patches, chapped hands, eczema-prone elbows and knees.<\/p>",
            "button_label": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ingredient-card-1",
        "ingredient-card-2"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image_ratio": "adapt",
        "image_position": "top",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "show_divider": false,
        "image_width": "full",
        "columns_desktop": 2,
        "heading": "How the routine works.",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "heading_alignment": "center",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "columns_mobile": "1",
        "swipe_on_mobile": false,
        "padding_top": 12,
        "padding_bottom": 36
      }
    },
    "founder-block": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "founder-heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "From The Founder",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "founder-body": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>During our family's healthy-ingredients journey, the customer who came back to us most often was the one with sensitive skin — the person whose skin reacts to fragrance, parabens, dimethicone, or mineral oil. We built every formula from there.<\/p><p>The Sensitive Skin Moisturizing Set pairs our two most reactive-skin-friendly products: a daily lotion and an overnight cream. Pure Unscented in both.<\/p><p>— Sean Fillmore<\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "founder-heading",
        "founder-body"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/founder-landscape.webp",
        "image_position": "center center",
        "layout": "text_first",
        "text_box_position": "middle",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "image_ratio": "adapt",
        "enlarge_content": false,
        "full_width": true,
        "show_divider": false,
        "mobile_layout": "image_first",
        "mobile_text_alignment": "left",
        "mobile_image_ratio": "auto",
        "use_custom_colors": true,
        "colors_button_label": "#ffffff",
        "colors_button_background": "#1a1b18",
        "colors_text": "#212326",
        "colors_background": "#faf7f0",
        "gradient_background": "",
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 36
      }
    },
    "free-from-block": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>.free-from-band{background:#eef3e8;padding:72px 0;text-align:center;margin-left:calc(-50vw + 50%);margin-right:calc(-50vw + 50%);width:100vw}.free-from-band__inner{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px}.free-from-band__heading{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.25rem);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;color:#1a1b18;margin:0 0 48px 0;letter-spacing:-0.01em}.free-from-band__list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px 32px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;max-width:1100px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}.free-from-band__list li{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;gap:14px;font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.25;font-weight:600;color:#1a1b18;text-align:left}.free-from-band__list li::before{content:\"✗\";color:#4a8b3c;font-size:1.7em;font-weight:800;line-height:1;flex-shrink:0}@media(max-width:900px){.free-from-band__list{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px 24px;max-width:520px}}@media(max-width:480px){.free-from-band__list{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;max-width:280px}.free-from-band{padding:48px 0}.free-from-band__heading{font-size:1.625rem;margin-bottom:32px}}<\/style><div class=\"free-from-band\"><div class=\"free-from-band__inner\"><h2 class=\"free-from-band__heading\">What's NOT in either jar or bottle<\/h2><ul class=\"free-from-band__list\"><li>Mineral oil or petroleum jelly<\/li><li>Petrolatum<\/li><li>Silicones<\/li><li>Lanolin<\/li><li>Parabens<\/li><li>Preservatives you&#39;d need to look up<\/li><li>Synthetic fragrance<\/li><li>Essential oils (Pure Unscented)<\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div>",
        "full_width": true,
        "show_divider": false,
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq-eczema": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will this work if I have eczema, rosacea, or perioral dermatitis?",
            "row_content": "<p>We can't make medical claims and don't sell our products as treatments. What we can tell you: we built the set around what reactive skin most often doesn't tolerate — synthetic fragrance, parabens, mineral oil, dimethicone, lanolin. Many of our customers with eczema, rosacea, or perioral dermatitis report fewer reactions on this set than on conventional drugstore lotions. If you've reacted to multiple products before, the lotion + cream pairing is the closest thing we offer to a clean-slate routine.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq-results": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long until I see results?",
            "row_content": "<p>Most customers feel the difference at first application — the lotion absorbs within minutes, the cream forms a soft barrier overnight. Real changes in dry-patch frequency or chronic reactivity typically take 2–3 weeks of consistent use. If you've been cycling through irritating products, the first week is sometimes about what you stop putting on, not just what you start.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq-patch-test": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Should I patch test first?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes — especially if you've reacted to multiple products in the past. Apply a small amount to the inside of your wrist or behind your ear and wait 24 hours. No redness, itching, or stinging means you're clear to use it elsewhere. The lotion absorbs faster, so it's the easier of the two to patch test first.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq-react": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if my skin reacts to the set?",
            "row_content": "<p>Email us within 30 days. We'll refund you and you don't need to send anything back. We mean it — sensitive skin shouldn't have to gamble on a product that didn't work, and we'd rather know what triggered the reaction so we can keep refining what we make.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq-pregnancy": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it safe during pregnancy or while breastfeeding?",
            "row_content": "<p>Both Pure Unscented formulas are made without ingredients commonly flagged as pregnancy-cautions: no synthetic fragrance, no parabens, no phenoxyethanol, no essential oils. Many of our customers used both during pregnancy and while breastfeeding without issue. Talk to your provider if you're unsure — we can't make medical recommendations, but we can tell you what's not in the formulas.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq-baby": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use this on my baby or kids?",
            "row_content": "<p>Many parents use the lotion on kids — fragrance-free, dye-free, no lanolin, no dimethicone. The cream is heavier and works well on kids' dry patches and chapped hands. As with anything new on baby skin, patch test on a small area first. We aren't pediatricians; if your child has a diagnosed skin condition, ask their provider before adding anything new.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq-when": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Lotion vs. cream — when do I use each?",
            "row_content": "<p>Lotion in the morning and after showers — it absorbs in minutes and won't leave a residue under clothes. Cream at night, on dry patches, hands, feet, elbows, knees — anywhere skin needs more than a daytime lotion can give. The two work as a system: lotion for daily moisture, cream for repair.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq-unscented": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is the unscented version actually fragrance-free?",
            "row_content": "<p>No essential oils added to either Pure Unscented formula. You'll still detect a faint scent of beeswax and coconut — that's the ingredients themselves, not added fragrance. We don't use masking fragrance. If you've reacted to \"unscented\" products in the past, that's often masking fragrance neutralizing a base odor — we don't do that.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "faq-eczema",
        "faq-results",
        "faq-patch-test",
        "faq-react",
        "faq-pregnancy",
        "faq-baby",
        "faq-when",
        "faq-unscented"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "open_first_collapsible_row": false,
        "narrow": true,
        "show_divider": false,
        "heading": "FAQs",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "heading_alignment": "center",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 72
      }
    },
    "loox-product-reviews-app-section": {
      "type": "apps",
      "settings": {
        "include_margins": false,
        "show_divider": false,
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 36
      }
    },
    "why-it-works": {
      "type": "landing-health-image",
      "blocks": {
        "point-1": {
          "type": "point",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Synthetic fragrance — the #1 self-reported irritant",
            "icon_source": "built_in"
          }
        },
        "point-2": {
          "type": "point",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Petrolatum & mineral oil — occlusive but not breathable",
            "icon_source": "built_in"
          }
        },
